finding 1 9 unsafeOptionalChain	This optional chain can evaluate to `undefined`, and the code around it then reaches into that `undefined` rather than short-circuiting with it. The `?.` protects only the links inside its own chain: once the chain ends, the result is an ordinary value and the next access, call, spread, or destructuring throws a TypeError. Either extend the chain so the whole expression short-circuits, or supply a fallback with `??`.
